    "description": {
      "value": "When you Activate a smoke fan, it creates a cloud of colored smoke. The smoke fills a 5-foot radius. The creator chooses the smoke's color when creating the smoke fan. Creatures within the smoke's area are concealed, and all other creatures are concealed to them. The smoke lasts for 1 minute or until dissipated by a strong wind.\n\nThe smoke's radius is 20 feet, and the creator can choose for the smoke to be a mixture of colors.\n\nActivate (1 Action); Components Interact"
